e:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003eCitizenship:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"width: 74.168%;\"\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003eTop Secret, SCI Eligible\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003eMust be a U.S. Citizen\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"width: 25.832%;\"\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003eEducation\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"width: 74.168%;\"\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003eBachelor\u0026rsquo;s Degree\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"width: 25.832%;\"\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003eRequired Experience\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"width: 74.168%;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cul style\u003d\"list-style-type: disc;margin-left: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-left: 0in; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif;\u0027\u003e10 years of budget formulation and execution experience.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-left: 0in; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif;\u0027\u003e5 years of experience with the Planning, Program, Budgeting, and Execution (PPBE) phases of the DoD budget.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-left: 0in; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif;\u0027\u003e5 years of experience with budget formulation, enactment, and execution.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-left: 0in; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif;\u0027\u003e5 years of experience with monitoring organizational spending, managing required reports, and informing senior leaders on the status and availability of funds.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-left: 0in; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif;\u0027\u003e5 years of experience with complex technical project management to ensure alignment with mission goals.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"width: 25.832%;\"\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"width: 74.168%;\"\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:.25in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"width: 25.832%;\"\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003eSalary:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"width: 74.168%;\"\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003eCommensurate with experience\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResponsibilities:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003eSANCORP is seeking a Budget Analyst III to provide Administrative, Analytic, Scientific, Information Technology and Subject Matter Expertise Support Services in direct support to Research, Development, Test \u0026amp; Evaluation Activities within Office of the Under Secretary of War for Intelligence and Security (OUSW(I\u0026amp;S)). The following are examples of responsibilities:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul type\u003d\"disc\"\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-left: 0in; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif;\u0027\u003eProvides expertise in DoD Planning, Programming, Budgeting, and Execution (PPBE), strategic resource management, project and program management, strategic planning, and staff support for complex developmental and operational programs. Advises organizational leadership on resource requirements, budget formulation and execution, program performance, mission priorities, and risk.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-left: 0in; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif;\u0027\u003eSupports and coordinates complex projects across multiple organizations, managing scope, cost, schedule, resources, milestones, dependencies, risks, deliverables, and stakeholder requirements. Supports development of integrated project plans, performance metrics, dashboards, and executive-level reporting to ensure alignment with mission objectives.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-left: 0in; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif;\u0027\u003eSupports development and evaluation of budget submissions, spend plans, resource projections, execution strategies, and programmatic alternatives. Identifies funding gaps, execution risks, and resource constraints and develops defensible recommendations and courses of action. Assembles, reviews, coordinates, and submits Military Interdepartmental Purchase Request (MIPR) packages, ensuring funding documentation, supporting requirements, financial data, approvals, and required documentation are complete, accurate, and properly routed for execution.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-left: 0in; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif;\u0027\u003eSupports multidisciplinary analysis and staff support for strategic planning, requirements development, policy, program integration, acquisition, and operational activities. Prepares executive briefings, decision papers, staff packages, issue papers, budget justifications, and program assessments.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-left: 0in; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif;\u0027\u003eSupports evaluation of programs and processes for compliance with DoD policies, government standards, accounting principles, internal controls, and financial management requirements. Supports cross-functional teams and synchronizes technical, operational, financial, and programmatic efforts across DoD and the Intelligence Community.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003eSancorp Consulting LLC shall, in its discretion, modify or adjust the position to meet Sancorp\u0026rsquo;s changing needs. This job description is not a contract and may be adjusted as deemed appropriate at Sancorp\u0026rsquo;s sole discretion.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003eSancorp Consulting, LLC, is an SDVOSB and SBA 8(a) company seeking highly motivated and qualified professionals and offer an attractive salary and benefits package that includes: Medical, Dental, life and Disability Insurance; 401K, and holidays to ensure the highest quality of life for our employees. Please visit our website for more information at\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href\u003d\"http://www.sancorpconsulting.com\" target\u003d\"_blank\" style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003ewww.sancorpconsulting.com\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-family: \u0027times new roman\u0027,serif;\"\u003eSancorp Consulting, LLC is an equal opportunity employer. At Sancorp Consulting, LLC we are committed to providing equal employment opportunities (EEO) to all employees and applicants without regard to race color, religion, sex, national origin, age, disability, or any other protected characteristic as defined by applicable law. We strive to create an inclusive and diverse workplace where everyone feels valued, respected, and supported.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\"margin-left:0in;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n","requisitionLocations":[{"aliasNames":[],"address":{"cityName":"Arlington","countrySubdivisionLevel1":{"codeValue":"VA"},"postalCode":"22102"},"nameCode":{"shortName":" Arlington, VA, US"}}]}